    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 6th level, when you use @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.gDYkQutLZB3JLuOh]{Step of the Wind} chi feature you gain a flying speed equal to half your movement speed until the end of your turn. If you end your turn in the air, you immediately fall to the ground.</p><p>In addition, you can use your reaction when you fall to reduce any falling damage you take by an amount equal to twice your monk level.</p>",
